41<lb/> <head>Fig Pudding</head><lb/> 1/2 lb. of Figs chopped fine, 6 ozs of sugar 6 ozs of<lb/> bread crumbs 4 ozs of Suet. boil it 1 hour + a 1/2 and<lb/> serve it up with Wine or Brandy Sauce, mix<lb/> your <sic>ingridients</sic> with 3 Eggs, and make good<lb/> weight in your breadcrumbs.<lb/> <head>Marmalade Pudding.</head><lb/> <unclear>Five</unclear> ozs. bread crumbs 6 ozs Suet, 6 ozs. moist<lb/> sugar, 4 eggs and 2 spoonfuls of marmalade<lb/> choped mix all together and let it<lb/> stand all night. boil it four hours stand<lb/> Wine, or Brandy Sauce to table with it.
