134<lb/> <head>Cough No. 3</head><lb/> Treacle, Vinegar &amp; Water 1/2 lb of each, Tinc<lb/> -ture of Squills 1 oz. <unclear>Spiciuana</unclear>, 1 oz of<lb/> Laudanum, 1 Teaspoonful to be taken<lb/> occasionally. Some think it best without,<lb/> the Laudanum.<lb/> <head>Cure for the Influenza</head><lb/> 1 Tablespoonful of sweet Spirit of Nitre, +<lb/> 2 spoonful of Varagorie Elixir mixed together<lb/> and taken in a Wine glass of hot sugar<lb/> + water on going to heat for 2 or 3 consecutive<lb/> nights, also a 1/4 oz. of Epsom salts dissolved<lb/> in a Teacup of water &amp; taken on each fol<lb/> -lowing morning. the patient being careful<lb/> to keep the feet warm &amp; dry. Living<lb/> on a light diet.<lb/> <head>To be taken after Measles</head><lb/> 2 d. worth of Syrup of Buekthorn &amp; 2 d. worth<lb/> of Tincture of Salop. 2 Teaspoonful at a time<lb/> <head>To Cure a full Throat</head><lb/> Take of diadate of Potash 1/2 a drachm<lb/> Spermaciti Cerate 1 oz. Take of this Ointment<lb/> the size of a nut, &amp; rub it hard on the
