3<lb/> Italian Cheese.-<lb/> Mix one pint of thick cream, half a <del>to</del><lb/> fine sugar put to it the Grated peel &amp; juice<lb/> of three Lemons, beat or wisk it one way<lb/> for half an Hour put it in a Sieve with<lb/> <del>the</del> a Cloth laid smooth at the bottom, at<lb/> it stand one night &amp; be kept in a cool<lb/> place, be careful how you turn it out.-<lb/> <pb/> The famous American recipe for Rhumatism<lb/> Two cloves of Garlic, 1 drachm of Gum Ammonide<lb/> blend them in 2 or 3 <unclear>Golusses</unclear> with fair water,<lb/> swallow one at night, + one in the morng.<lb/> while using this recipe Quick <unclear>saspas</unclear><lb/> tea made very strong, so as to have the teapot<lb/> fill'd with chips- This is generally found<lb/> to banish the rhumatiom, &amp; even contraction<lb/> in the joints, in a few <unclear>times</unclear> taking -
