15<lb/> Carrot Soup-<lb/> Take 1 lb. of Veal, + 1 lb. of lean Ham, + 1 lb.<lb/> of lean Beef. Cut them in slices, + stew them<lb/> when boiling Hot slice in 16. Carrots, 6 Turnips<lb/> 6 Heads of Celery, 3 large Onions, + a Lettuce.<lb/> some Pepper + salt. Let these stew in one<lb/> Gallon of Water three or four Hours till they are<lb/> quite Tender. then rub it through a Cullender<lb/> put in a piece of Butter the size of a Walnut<lb/> braided in Flour, give a boil over the Fire,<lb/> stirring it all the time + serve it to Table<lb/> <pb/> Oil of Almanate for Mahogony.-<lb/> 4 pennyworth of Almonate Root, 2 pennyworth<lb/> of Rose Pink, put to one Pint of cold drawn<lb/> Linseed Oil. - let these infuse well in a warm<lb/> Place. - rub it on the Furniture with a linnen<lb/> Rag. Polish it when quite dry.
