16<lb/> Ragout of Oysters-<lb/> Make a rich Batter as for Pancakes. put into<lb/> it some Pepper, Salt, grated Lemon Peel, chopt<lb/> Parsley, + Lemon Thyme. dip the Oysters in<lb/> this Batter fry them in Butter of a light<lb/> Brown. - then take them out shake in some<lb/> Flour, + put in a small Piece of Butter,<lb/> put in some nice gravy, + the oyster Liquor<lb/> strained lest any pieces of Shell should be<lb/> in it. put in a little white wine, + if the Sauce<lb/> should not be thick enough add a small piece<lb/> of Butter braided in Flour. put in the Oysters<lb/> to warm, + serve it to Table. - garnish<lb/> with Lemon.
