66<lb/> <hi rend="underline">To make Pop-</hi><lb/> Take two ounces <add>and a half</add> of cream of Tarter, the same<lb/> quantity of ginger, the Peel and juice of two<lb/> Lemons, two pounds and a half of Loaf Sugar,<lb/> put the above ingredients into a large<lb/> <unclear>carther-wan</unclear> pan, and pour on them two<lb/> gallons and two quarts of boiling water-<lb/> let it stand till cool, then add a quarter<lb/> of a pint of fresh yeast stir it well up, bottle<lb/> it in <unclear>stow</unclear> half pint<del>s</del> Bottles, cork them Down<lb/> immediately and Win them down. -<lb/> they must be <hi rend="underline">kept in a cool</hi> place, with<lb/> the mouth of the <hi rend="underline">bottle downwards.-</hi>
