<hi rend="underline">Orange Marmalade</hi> <lb/> <hi rend="underline"><unclear>Mip</unclear> Seeds</hi><lb/> <hi rend="underline">4 lbs <unclear>Gauges</unclear></hi><lb/> Boil till the head of a pin will pass<lb/> through. about <hi rend="underline">4 hours -</hi><lb/> then cut into very thin slices re-<lb/> moving pips and skin-<lb/> 7 lbs loaf sugar. <lb/> 1 1/2 Pint of water. <lb/> simmer till quite clear - <lb/> skimming well - then add<lb/> the orange and boil slowly 'til<lb/> quite transparent.<lb/> If preferred bitter, use 1/2 Pint<lb/> of the water the oranges were boiled<lb/> in. with a pint of clear water.
