140<lb/> Orange Jelly<lb/> <pb/> Take twelve oranges, + six ozs sugar<lb/> in one Lump- rub six oranges<lb/> on the Sugar to <unclear>another</unclear> the taste<lb/> of the peel - Squeeze the piece<lb/> of the 12 oranges on the sugar<lb/> to add a bitter 15 other to make a<lb/> <unclear>moth</unclear>. dissolve 2 ozs Isinglass<lb/> + put all into a shape + fill it<lb/> with water - then strain into a<lb/> saucepan boil for four minutes<lb/> strain into a bowl + add two<lb/> Glasses of white wine keep stir<lb/> =ring 'til it begins to thicken the<lb/> <unclear>first the stop</unclear> - this quantity for <lb/> one large or two small shapes<lb/> <pb/> For Making Freezing Powders<lb/> <pb/> <unclear>Mureat</unclear> of <unclear>Amsnonia</unclear> Six parts<lb/> Nitrate of Pot ash Light paste<lb/> <pb/>
