141<lb/> Savory Jelly<lb/> <pb/> For one shape - 1/2 an Oz Isinglass<lb/> 1/2 <hi rend="underline">lb</hi> Sugar, the Juice of four Oranges<lb/> + 5 Lemons whip all together, +<lb/> till a <unclear><hi rend="underline">delph</hi></unclear> shapes. make rich<lb/> sauce of port wine, white sugar, + show<lb/> hung Jam piece, + in simmer it<lb/> is like Tea when <unclear>drine</unclear> out of the shape<lb/>
