To make a Fruit or Scotch Cake<lb/> Beat 1 <hi rend="superscript">lb</hi> of fresh butter to a cream<lb/> with 1 <hi rend="superscript">lb</hi> of pounded white sugar + while<lb/> beating drop in by degrees the yolks of<lb/> 10 Eggs - Beat the whites of the Eggs<lb/> to a snow + mix t<gap/> with the above<lb/> + 1 <hi rend="superscript">lb</hi> of fruit <unclear>convincing</unclear> <add>of</add> currants<lb/> <gap/> Citron <gap/> Orange Lemon
