An infallible Recipe for destroying Rats. <lb/> Take Ten pennyworth of <add>nice</add> Wax Vomiea. Finely pounded or rasped<lb/> one Quart of oat moat, one pint of Boiled Potatoes, half a pound<lb/> of Brown Sugar, and as much milk as will make the whole<lb/> when mixed into a Dough or paste. place this in the paths<lb/> of the Rats, and in three nights it will not leave a living<lb/> Rat- This with the addition of a small quantity of oil of<lb/> Rhodium is the celebrated and effectual <unclear>seuet</unclear> of professed<lb/> <unclear>Ratcaldies</unclear>- <lb/> <pb/> <head>To Clean Tables</head><lb/> 4 ounces of Bees wax. 4 Oz vinegar virgin wax mix them together<lb/> add 6 ounces of Roses pink. stir this into it until it <unclear>gweed</unclear><lb/> thick and add a Table spoonful of Spirits of Turpentine-<lb/> This will last a long time.-<lb/> <pb/> <head>A Receipt for Naple Biscuit.-</head><lb/> Seven Eggs. Yolks and Eggs beat separately, beat in one pound<lb/> and a quarter of sugar, one pound of flour, and some Caraway<lb/> seeds drop them on this and cover them completely, a Desert<lb/> spoonful is enough for one Cake.<lb/> <pb/> <head>Eye water</head><lb/> 6 Desert Spoonfuls of Hungary water to a pint of Rose water-<lb/> use it every day.
