48<lb/> Raisin Wine - Daddy <unclear>Garbrand</unclear><lb/> <pb/> 6 p<hi rend="superscript">d</hi> of <unclear>Smyma</unclear> Raisins<lb/> 1 p<hi rend="superscript">d</hi> 1/2 of Malaga D<hi rend="superscript">o</hi><lb/> to 1 Gall<hi rend="superscript">n</hi> of Water<lb/> the Fruit must be put into a Cask, Stalks<lb/> and all as they come from The Grocers<lb/> it must be well stind with a strong<lb/> stick at the bung Hole every day till<lb/> it has done working then the Fruit will<lb/> rise to the top it must be bung'd down<lb/> close and let it stand till fine. I have<lb/> drank it from the Cask by this <lb/> reciepe as clear as possible<lb/> <pb/>
<!-- DO NOT EDIT BELOW THIS LINE --> {{Metadata:{{PAGENAME}}}}

