open, + should be taken. daily for some weeks<lb/> 1, 2 or 3 pills as the constitution requires it<lb/> <pb/> Dr Parnells Reic<add>pe</add> for bowel complaints<lb/> and acidity.<lb/> Take of Japan Earth two Drachams<lb/> Gum Arab: 1/2 an Ounce.<lb/> Cinnamon <unclear>bruised</unclear> one Dr<hi rend="underline">m</hi><lb/> Chalk two D<hi rend="underline">rms</hi><lb/> <lb/> Put these into an earthen vessel + pour<lb/> on them half a pint of boiling water.<lb/> Let them infuse for one night, + then<lb/> decant off the liquor + take two table<lb/> spoonfulls twice a day. If the <unclear>Drachds</unclear><lb/> continues too long, take it tepid after<lb/> every loose stool, + fine drops of Landanum<lb/> may be added when the discharge is free
