<head>Chalk <unclear>Julep</unclear> -</head><lb/> Take a bit of fine chalk about the size of<lb/> a Walnut heat it in a mortar + put to it<lb/> some fine powdered sugar, then pour it<lb/> 8 Ounces of cold Water stirring it all the time<lb/> till the Chalk + Sugar are dissolved - bottle<lb/> it for use - <lb/> <head><unclear>Opodeldae</unclear> -</head> <lb/> A Quarter of a pound of <unclear>Gas</unclear> till soap <add>scraped</add> 2 Oz of<lb/> Camphor put them into a Bottle pourd on<lb/> them a pint of the best spirits of wine + half<lb/> a pint of good Rum - shake the Bottle<lb/> frequently untill the soap + Camphor be<lb/> dissolved- It will keep for years<lb/> M<hi rend="superscript">rs</hi> Lowe
