Small Cup Pudding very<lb/> <add>The</add> Weight of 3 Eggs in the Shell, the<lb/> Sugar, + flour, mixed <hi rend="underline">very</hi><lb/> seasoned with Lemon grate<lb/> very flavour your prifer<lb/> Cups + bake 3/4 of an hour<lb/> be well buttered- Miss<lb/> <pb/> Ginger Wine-<lb/> Ten gallons of water, wine m<lb/> Lisbon sugar, boil them 1/2 <lb/> off the skim as it <gap/>
