(Ginger Wine<lb/> 6 Gallons of Water,<lb/> lump sugar, let it b<lb/> + add 3/4 of a lb of wh<lb/> the rinds of 8 lemns<lb/> then put it into an ope<lb/> milk warm, put in thr<lb/> it it stand one night<lb/> it into your Barrel, ad<lb/> bung it up Close for a<lb/> off into another barrel<lb/> of Brandy + 1/2 an oz of<lb/> 4 <gap/> then bottle
