of Ginger + boil it in<lb/> till it is tender, then<lb/> + when new milk war<lb/> fresh yeast - Chop<lb/> put them into the<lb/> upon them, Steep<lb/> in a quart of Bran<lb/> + when the wine has<lb/> then with Brady +<lb/> Cask with one oz. of<lb/> + bottle it in 3 months
